  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Nikesh Arora (born February 9, 1968) is an Indian-American billionaire business executive. He is currently the chairman and chief executive officer of the American cybersecurity company Palo Alto Networks. \nArora was formerly a senior executive at Google and president of SoftBank Group from October 2014 to June 2016. According to the Bloomberg Billionaires Index, his net worth was estimated at $1.5 billion in early 2024.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
  },
